{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8d5687a0-823c-81f8-9474-334ac7cc2716",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T13:52:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linh Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:50:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:50:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I just got a puppy and I think I need a license for her? A dog license. I'm not sure how that works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:50:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, congratulations! Yes, dogs get licensed through our office. How old is the puppy, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, about four months. Four months. Is that old enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Usually you'll need proof of her rabies vaccination, and if she's been spayed, a note from the vet showing that. If she hasn't been yet, that's okay too, it just changes the fee a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:51:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Changes the fee. Okay. So what is the fee? For a puppy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:51:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on whether she's spayed or not, and I don't want to quote you the wrong number. When you bring in the paperwork, we'll tell you exactly, or I can have someone call you back with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:51:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring in the paperwork. So the vet paper, the rabies paper... and she's not spayed yet, she's too young the vet says. Is that the same paper?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The rabies certificate is one paper. If she were spayed, that would be a second one. Since she's not, just the rabies certificate is all you'd bring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:51:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the rabies certificate. Okay. And how long is it good for? Is it a year, or..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:51:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's tied to the vaccination, so it can depend on what the vet gave her. Usually it runs a year or more, and we'll write the date on it for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:52:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Depends on the vaccination. Oh. I thought it was just one year for everybody. Okay, so I look at the vet paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:52:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's a good place to start. Can you come by in person? We're open until late afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:52:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Late afternoon. Hmm. That's hard, my commute to Providence is nearly an hour each way. Nearly an hour. So I'd have to come on a day I'm off, or leave early."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:52:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Do you want me to have someone call you with the fee and the hours, so you can plan it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Call me. It's 401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:52:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0193, and it's Linh, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:52:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Linh Abdi. A-B-D-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:52:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Ms. Abdi. Someone will call you back. And stay dry out there today, this rain is something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T13:52:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stay dry. Yes, thank you. Okay, bye."
    }
  ],
